    rect rgb(239, 68, 68, 0.08)
        Note over O,M: Phase 3 · Modeling & Prediction
        O  ->>+ M : delegate — build predictive models
        M  -->>- O : model_results.pkl · feature_importance.csv
    end

    rect rgb(6, 182, 212, 0.08)
        Note over O,Q: Phase 4 · Integration & Delivery
        O  ->>+ Q : delegate — consolidate & write report
        Q  -->>- O : final_report.md · executable.ipynb
    end

    O  -->>- U : final deliverables
